        },
        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Let \\(T_n\\) be the general term of a geometric sequence. It is given that \\(T_1=672\\) and \\(125T_2=-8T_5\\).\n(a) Find \\(T_n\\).\n(b) If the 7th term is \\(25/4\\) times the mth term, (i) find the value of \\(m\\), (ii) find the sum of the first \\(m\\) terms of the sequence."
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "設 \\(T_n\\) 為一等比數列的通項。已知 \\(T_1=672\\) 及 \\(125T_2=-8T_5\\)。\n(a) 求 \\(T_n\\)。\n(b) 若第 7 項為第 \\(m\\) 項的 \\(25/4\\) 倍，(i) 求 \\(m\\)，(ii) 求首 \\(m\\) 項之和。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
          "before": null,
          "after": "(a) Write \\(T_n=672r^{n-1}\\). The condition gives \\[125(672r)=-8(672r^4),\\quad 672r(125+8r^3)=0.\\] Do not divide by \\(r\\) before checking zero. Thus \\(r=0\\) or \\(r=-5/2\\). For \\(r=0\\), state the sequence without a \\(0^0\\) convention: \\(T_1=672\\), \\(T_n=0\\) for every integer \\(n\\ge2\\). Otherwise, \\(T_n=672(-5/2)^{n-1}\\).\n(b) If \\(r=-5/2\\), then \\(T_7/T_m=(-5/2)^{7-m}=25/4=(-5/2)^2\\). Taking absolute values gives \\(7-m=2\\), hence \\(m=5\\); its even exponent also checks the sign. The sum is \\[S_5=672\\frac{1-(-5/2)^5}{1+5/2}=18942.\\] If \\(r=0\\), then \\(T_7=(25/4)T_m\\) is satisfied by every integer \\(m\\ge2\\), and \\(S_m=672\\). The case \\(m=1\\) fails.\nSource-answer note: the printed short answer lists only the nonzero-ratio branch. Under the printed conditions both branches above must be retained, so part (b) does not determine a unique m unless a nonzero ratio is specified."
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "(a) 設 \\(T_n=672r^{n-1}\\)。由條件得 \\[125(672r)=-8(672r^4),\\quad 672r(125+8r^3)=0.\\] 未檢查零值前不可除以 \\(r\\)。故 \\(r=0\\) 或 \\(r=-5/2\\)。當 \\(r=0\\)，直接寫 \\(T_1=672\\)，所有整數 \\(n\\ge2\\) 均有 \\(T_n=0\\)，避免使用 \\(0^0\\)。另一分支為 \\(T_n=672(-5/2)^{n-1}\\)。\n(b) 當 \\(r=-5/2\\)，有 \\(T_7/T_m=(-5/2)^{7-m}=25/4=(-5/2)^2\\)。先比較絕對值得 \\(7-m=2\\)，故 \\(m=5\\)，偶次方亦符合正號。首五項和為 \\[S_5=672\\frac{1-(-5/2)^5}{1+5/2}=18942.\\] 當 \\(r=0\\)，每個整數 \\(m\\ge2\\) 均符合 \\(T_7=(25/4)T_m\\)，且 \\(S_m=672\\)；\\(m=1\\) 不符合。\n來源答案說明：原卷簡答只列非零公比分支。按原題條件須保留以上兩個分支；未限制公比非零時，(b) 的 m 並非唯一。"
        },
