        {
          "field": "solutionBlocks",
          "before": null,
          "after": {
            "en": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "(a) Write \\(T_n=672r^{n-1}\\). The condition gives \\[125(672r)=-8(672r^4),\\quad 672r(125+8r^3)=0.\\] Do not divide by \\(r\\) before checking zero. Thus \\(r=0\\) or \\(r=-5/2\\). For \\(r=0\\), state the sequence without a \\(0^0\\) convention: \\(T_1=672\\), \\(T_n=0\\) for every integer \\(n\\ge2\\). Otherwise, \\(T_n=672(-5/2)^{n-1}\\)."
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "(b) If \\(r=-5/2\\), then \\(T_7/T_m=(-5/2)^{7-m}=25/4=(-5/2)^2\\). Taking absolute values gives \\(7-m=2\\), hence \\(m=5\\); its even exponent also checks the sign. The sum is \\[S_5=672\\frac{1-(-5/2)^5}{1+5/2}=18942.\\] If \\(r=0\\), then \\(T_7=(25/4)T_m\\) is satisfied by every integer \\(m\\ge2\\), and \\(S_m=672\\). The case \\(m=1\\) fails."
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Source-answer note: the printed short answer lists only the nonzero-ratio branch. Under the printed conditions both branches above must be retained, so part (b) does not determine a unique m unless a nonzero ratio is specified."
              }
            ],
            "zh-Hant": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "(a) 設 \\(T_n=672r^{n-1}\\)。由條件得 \\[125(672r)=-8(672r^4),\\quad 672r(125+8r^3)=0.\\] 未檢查零值前不可除以 \\(r\\)。故 \\(r=0\\) 或 \\(r=-5/2\\)。當 \\(r=0\\)，直接寫 \\(T_1=672\\)，所有整數 \\(n\\ge2\\) 均有 \\(T_n=0\\)，避免使用 \\(0^0\\)。另一分支為 \\(T_n=672(-5/2)^{n-1}\\)。"
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "(b) 當 \\(r=-5/2\\)，有 \\(T_7/T_m=(-5/2)^{7-m}=25/4=(-5/2)^2\\)。先比較絕對值得 \\(7-m=2\\)，故 \\(m=5\\)，偶次方亦符合正號。首五項和為 \\[S_5=672\\frac{1-(-5/2)^5}{1+5/2}=18942.\\] 當 \\(r=0\\)，每個整數 \\(m\\ge2\\) 均符合 \\(T_7=(25/4)T_m\\)，且 \\(S_m=672\\)；\\(m=1\\) 不符合。"
              },
